Package: slopweb
Version: {version}
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: {architecture}
Maintainer: Lev Gorodetskii <slopworld@drsr.io>
Depends: nodejs (>= 22), python3 (>= 3.11), dotnet-runtime-10.0
Suggests: slopd
Homepage: https://github.com/droserasprout/slopworld
Description: Local browser Eco workspace for SlopWorld coding agents
 Runs the actual mod and game code locally in WebAssembly. Requires a local
 Waylith/RimWorld 1.7 installation; game data is prepared privately at launch
 and is not included in this package. Connects to a local or remote slopd.
